{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>And the altars.</b> Both of them." "<b>And the sacred utensils with which they serve.</b> These are the utensils of the menorah and the table and the altars. Many erred in explaining \"and the screen and all its service,\" but the truth is clear that it is the screen of the entrance of the Tent of Meeting." "<b>And all its service:</b> its cords."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:08.754658305Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}